    "policies": {
      "collector": "Keep the pantry stocked. Choose safe foraging when enemies threaten the routes; choose bold foraging when supplies run low and routes are clear. A full basket returns home automatically. Take a break when stamina is low or you need recovery; a fully rested healthy villager has no useful reason to relax. The visible automatic-needs rule gets food when your hunger is low; your decision controls the longer-term job, not each meal.",
